oris-trace 1
# calloc is alloc of count x size (then zeroed); a sized free takes the size the block
# was allocated with, a sized aligned free the size and alignment.
calloc h0 4 8
calloc h1 100 10
calloc h2 0 8
alloc h3 300
alloc_aligned h4 200 64
free_sized h0 32
free_sized h1 1000
free h2
free_sized h3 300
free_sized_aligned h4 200 64
purge
